# PLC Update Program - File Timestamp Comparison System

> A complete, production-ready system for comparing file timestamps across distributed host computers and maintaining a centralized file repository.

## 🚀 Quick Start

```bash
# 1. Run the application
dotnet run

# 2. Open browser
https://localhost:7xxx/file-updates

# 3. Start syncing files!
```

See [QUICKSTART.md](QUICKSTART.md) for detailed instructions.

---

## 📋 What This Does

✅ **Compare file timestamps** across multiple host computers
✅ **Maintain a centralized repository** of latest file versions  
✅ **Track version history** and identify which host has the newest version
✅ **Distribute updates** to host computers based on current versions
✅ **Generate compliance reports** for auditing
✅ **Provide REST API** for full automation

