## 🔌 REST API

8 endpoints for full automation:

```bash
# Sync files from a host
POST /api/fileupdate/sync?hostName=MACHINE-01
Body: ["C:\\file1.exe", "C:\\file2.ini"]

# Get all repository files
GET /api/fileupdate/all

# Get files from specific host
GET /api/fileupdate/host/MACHINE-01

# Get latest version of a file
GET /api/fileupdate/latest/config.ini

# Get updates for a host
GET /api/fileupdate/distribute/MACHINE-02

# Get latest of everything
GET /api/fileupdate/updates-required

# Generate report
GET /api/fileupdate/report

# Analyze a file
POST /api/fileupdate/analyze?filePath=C:\file.exe&hostName=MACHINE-01
```

See [README-FileTimestampSystem.md](README-FileTimestampSystem.md) for detailed API reference.

