## 💾 Data Storage

**Location**: `Data/Repository/file_timestamps.db`

**Format**: Plain text, pipe-delimited (human-readable)

**Backup**: Simple file copy

```
fileName|filePath|fileSize|lastModifiedUtc|sha256Hash|hostName|repositoryLastUpdated
config.ini|C:\Program Files\MyApp\config.ini|2048|2024-01-15T10:30:00Z|abc123...|MACHINE-01|2024-01-15T10:31:00Z
```

