## 🔄 Typical Workflows

### 1. Initial Setup
```
Identify all critical files
  ↓
Sync them using /api/fileupdate/sync
  ↓
Repository now contains baseline versions
```

### 2. Monitor for Changes
```
Set up scheduled sync on host computers
  ↓
Files change on a host
  ↓
Next sync detects changes
  ↓
Repository updates with new version
```

### 3. Distribute Updates
```
Query /api/fileupdate/distribute/TARGET-HOST
  ↓
Get list of files needing update
  ↓
Copy files from source paths
  ↓
Verify using SHA256 hashes
  ↓
Deploy to target host
```

### 4. Compliance Reporting
```
Generate /api/fileupdate/report
  ↓
Shows all files and version history
  ↓
Shows which host provides latest version
  ↓
Export for audit purposes
```

See [USAGE-GUIDE.md](USAGE-GUIDE.md) for detailed workflows.

